            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This paper investigates gentrification in the Mission District of San Francisco. It makes a distinction between supply- and demand-side gentrification and examines the causes and effects of each individually. Finally, it proposes a plan of action for the San Francisco city government to balance the city’s cultural and economic interests.",
